# Temporary suppressions for the Trivy image scan of the `tools` kit
# (tools/tools.dockerfile).
#
# All findings below are in the native `tsc` binary,
# @typescript/typescript-linux-x64@7.0.2 (TypeScript 7's Go-compiled native
# compiler), from the Go toolchain (1.26.4) and golang.org/x/net and
# golang.org/x/text modules it was built against. typescript@7.0.2 is the
# latest stable release as of 2026-10-28, so there is no newer release to bump
# to yet (only 7.1.0-beta and nightly builds exist).
#
# Revisit when this suppression expires: re-run Trivy against the tools kit
# image. If a newer typescript has been published with a patched Go toolchain,
# bump it and drop the entries below. If not, extend the expiry only after a
# fresh review of the current advisory state -- do not blindly re-up these
# dates.

